### Registrar usuário
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ermeson Gomes",
  "email": "ermeson@email.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ermeson@email.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### Listar carteiras
GET http://localhost:8080/api/households
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar categoria de receita
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": 1,
  "name": "Salário",
  "type": "INCOME",
  "color": "#22c55e"
}

### Criar categoria de despesa
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": 1,
  "name": "Aluguel",
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "color": "#ef4444"
}

### Criar receita
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": 1,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "description": "Salário mensal",
  "amount": 3500.00,
  "type": "INCOME",
  "dueDate": "2026-05-10",
  "paid": true
}

### Criar despesa
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": 1,
  "categoryId": 2,
  "description": "Aluguel",
  "amount": 900.00,
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "dueDate": "2026-05-15",
  "paid": false
}

### Criar dívida parcelada
POST http://localhost:8080/api/debts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": 1,
  "description": "Notebook",
  "creditor": "Loja XPTO",
  "totalAmount": 3600.00,
  "installments": 12,
  "firstDueDate": "2026-05-20"
}

### Criar meta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": 1,
  "name": "Reserva de emergência",
  "targetAmount": 10000.00,
  "currentAmount": 500.00,
  "deadline": "2026-12-31"
}

### Relatório mensal
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/monthly?householdId=1&year=2026&month=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Gerar notificações manualmente
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notifications/generate?householdId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Exportar PDF
GET http://localhost:8080/api/exports/monthly/pdf?householdId=1&year=2026&month=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Exportar Excel
GET http://localhost:8080/api/exports/monthly/excel?householdId=1&year=2026&month=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
